(7595278, 1225461, 87808, '<td valign="top">What a fabulous photo of a great time that was had by all. They look like right mischief makers! The chap''s shorts on the left though are in focus versus the kiddies.</td>', 'What a fabulous photo of a great time that was had by all. They look like right mischief makers! The chap''s shorts on the left though are in focus versus the kiddies.', '2018-09-06 15:26:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595279, 1225399, 87808, '<td valign="top">I really like how this makes me feel warm when I look at it.  Could be the grins of the boys, could be the golden sparkly vegetation. But it gives out an abundance of warmth.  Very well done!</td>', 'I really like how this makes me feel warm when I look at it.  Could be the grins of the boys, could be the golden sparkly vegetation. But it gives out an abundance of warmth.  Very well done!', '2018-09-06 15:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
