(7595281, 1225416, 87808, '<td valign="top">Oh my goodness, but is that gorgeous, a little too sharp maybe, but WOW on the eyes, stunning wing structure and colour.  Can not give it anything but a 9</td>', 'Oh my goodness, but is that gorgeous, a little too sharp maybe, but WOW on the eyes, stunning wing structure and colour.  Can not give it anything but a 9', '2018-09-06 15:29:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595282, 1224779, 87808, '<td valign="top">Well, what can you say.  Not your usual point of view and it is fabulous!!!!!! I love it, the wings curling, the softness of the yellow, the head sharpness. You know exactly what this is, without seeing what it is. Outstanding job.  Can not give this anything other than a 10</td>', 'Well, what can you say.  Not your usual point of view and it is fabulous!!!!!! I love it, the wings curling, the softness of the yellow, the head sharpness. You know exactly what this is, without seeing what it is. Outstanding job.  Can not give this anything other than a 10', '2018-09-06 15:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595283, 1224679, 87808, '<td valign="top">Everyone looks so tired and done for the day. I enjoyed reading the poem(?) about Manhood.</td>', 'Everyone looks so tired and done for the day. I enjoyed reading the poem(?) about Manhood.', '2018-09-06 15:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595284, 1225498, 87808, '<td valign="top">I have looked at this 3 times now, and every time I click on it, I swear the man in the reflections seems to be playing a piano.  It is a really fantastic optical illusion or it is my brain converting that car to fit the scene. Either way, if you just got rid of that rim, it would look like a piano. But it is brilliant. I love how this has tricked me every time I see it.  7</td>', 'I have looked at this 3 times now, and every time I click on it, I swear the man in the reflections seems to be playing a piano.  It is a really fantastic optical illusion or it is my brain converting that car to fit the scene. Either way, if you just got rid of that rim, it would look like a piano. But it is brilliant. I love how this has tricked me every time I see it.  7', '2018-09-06 15:33:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595285, 1225519, 87808, '<td valign="top">Wowsers! This is outstanding.  The thumbnail does not show the birds at all and then bam, there they are. An amazing image. 10 from me, it still greets me in surprise when I click on this.</td>', 'Wowsers! This is outstanding.  The thumbnail does not show the birds at all and then bam, there they are. An amazing image. 10 from me, it still greets me in surprise when I click on this.', '2018-09-06 15:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7595286, 1225319, 87808, '<td valign="top">This is brilliant, the green/blue''s of the ocean and pool. The wave and rock dynamic with the straight lines of modern life. Great photo. If you don''t mind me asking, is it legal to shoot people/properties like this??  I have always wandered?!</td>', 'This is brilliant, the green/blue''s of the ocean and pool. The wave and rock dynamic with the straight lines of modern life. Great photo. If you don''t mind me asking, is it legal to shoot people/properties like this??  I have always wandered?!', '2018-09-06 15:34:58.000000', NULL, 1),
